   "text": {
    "en": "Stamp Duties Act\n(Chapter 312, Section 74)\nOrder under Section 74\nO 11\nG.N. No. S 30/1999\nREVISED EDITION 2001\n(31st January 2001)\n[26th January 1999]\nThe Minister for Finance has remitted the whole of the duty chargeable under the Act on all contract notes made during the period 30th June 1998 to 29th June 2000 for the sale or purchase of any stocks or shares."
   }
  }
